        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pocahontas, The Game Plan\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Andy Fickman, Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, Audrey Wells, Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson\n- Topics: American film genres, billing credits\n\nFacts:\n- Pocahontas is a 1995 American animated musical romantic-comedy-drama film.\n- Walt Disney Feature Animation produced Pocahontas for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- The Game Plan is a 2007 American family comedy film.\n- Andy Fickman directed The Game Plan.\n- Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, and Audrey Wells wrote The Game Plan.\n- Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson starred in The Game Plan.\n- The Game Plan was the last film in which Dwayne Johnson was billed using his ring name \"The Rock.\"",
